  «text (-1100,500) 1 7 1 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿This example shows how to simulate the quantities of the General Feedback Theorem, which are defined in the article\n R. David Middlebrook, "The General Feedback Theorem: A Final Solution for Feedback Systems", IEEE Microwave Magazine, vol. 7, no. 2, pp. 50-63, April 2006.\nThis article can be downloaded from http://resolver.caltech.edu/CaltechAUTHORS:MIDieeemm06 .\nSee also message 18008 of the independent LTspice users' group at http://groups.yahoo.com/group/LTspice where this method was originally presented by Frank Wiedmann."»
